[gb_rewind_capture / gb_rewind_step]
Ghidra: Host history adapter; no guest address or hardware behavior inferred.
Rationale: The shared rb-engine owns compressed snapshots. Bound depth and bytes,
reset before uint32 sequence wrap, and discard an abandoned future only after a
successful transactional restore. Process capture/restore/failure counts stay
monotonic. The caller must be outside generated guest functions when restoring.
